# Google Drive OAuth2 Configuration

# 1. Go to Google Cloud Console → APIs & Services → Credentials
# 2. Create "OAuth 2.0 Client ID" (type: Desktop App)
# 3. Copy Client ID and Client Secret here:
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=xxxxx
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=xxxxx
GOOGLE_LOGIN_CLIENT_ID=xxxxxxxx

# 4. Run: cd server && npx tsx src/scripts/get-drive-token.ts
# 5. Follow the instructions to get a refresh token, then paste it here:
GOOGLE_REFRESH_TOKEN=xxxxx
# 6. Google Drive Folder ID (from URL: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/<THIS_ID>)
GOOGLE_DRIVE_FOLDER_ID=xxxx

GEMINI_API_KEY=xxxxxx